1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,617
Poora din Instagram chalati hoon, aur Mummy kehti hain time waste hai.

2
00:00:04,917 --> 00:00:09,703
Ishita, yahi time paisa ban sakta hai! Dukaanon ka social media sambhaal!

3
00:00:10,003 --> 00:00:12,774
Nani, aapko social media ka kaise pata?

4
00:00:13,074 --> 00:00:19,032
Meri reels pe bhi lakh views hain, beta! Laptop, achha phone aur ring light, 50 hazaar.

5
00:00:19,332 --> 00:00:25,350
Pehle teen dukaanon ka kaam saste mein kar. Unki bikri badhi, to poora bazaar tere paas aayega.

6
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:30,799
Ishita beta, mere restaurant pe koi nahi aata. Online kuch karo!

7
00:00:31,099 --> 00:00:34,964
Reels, post, Google review, sab. 8 hazaar mahina, uncle!

8
00:00:35,264 --> 00:00:38,956
Aath dukaanein, yaani mahine ke 64 hazaar. Ghar baithe!

9
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:43,495
Phir video editing aur ads chalana bhi seekh. Uska alag charge.

10
00:00:43,795 --> 00:00:47,318
Time waste nahi, time invest! Ishita ki life set!
